<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Beifu Army</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Northern Garrison Army</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Beifu Army was the main field army of the Eastern Jin dynasty of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>, raised by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/xie-xuan">Xie Xuan</a> in the late 370s from northern refugees settled around Guangling and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jingkou">Jingkou</a>. It won the great victory over the Former <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qin-dynasty">Qin</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-fei-river">Battle of Fei River</a> in 383. Its officers later dominated court politics, and one of them, Liu Yu, founded the Liu <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/song-dynasty">Song dynasty</a> in 420.</p></div>
